00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:28.250
You are following me all the time.

00:20:28.510 --> 00:20:29.970
I'm really an undercover person.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:36.280
police officer. I was searching for my father when I saw you with Regis. I knew you'd lead

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:42.900
me to daddy. As soon as you went into the subway, I radioed for backup. Yes, but how did you

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:48.680
find us in the cavern? Those tunnels went everywhere. It was Regis here who led us to

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:59.880
you. So Regis, is it? I've got something for you. Oh, I knew it all the time. James loves

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.020
that animal? Well, perhaps

00:21:02.020 --> 00:21:02.560
you're right.

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:03.860
I...

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:04.920
Wait!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:10.560
Yes, even

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:11.960
I know when I'm licked.

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:12.380
Music
